{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/web/page.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-03T17:03:47.822066Z","id":"385f577ba5758eaf1e482216402ec35fd7e328ac3a3449950009771be80fc3df","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:a15b5abf2","summary":"Fixed: html_encoding follows the WHATWG order (BOM, Content-Type charset, 1024-byte meta prescan, UTF-8) and decode_html uses it. Tests web::page::tests::an_html_pages_meta_charset_is_honoured and a_bom_and_then_the_header_beat_a_meta_charset pass in //crates/clax-bot:clax_bot_lib_test. just check at b44c2e9bc: 'Executed 53 out of 381 tests: 381 tests pass.' and 'bazel: all checks passed'.","supersedes":"edb97f87f913d4f28478c072b42423c6b66deb42cc51e6cc8ce6af01aa0b3444","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:ad4c0f0d-1745-4445-8c27-3925ac4b061a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/web/page.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-03T17:03:48.259461Z","id":"70aceb3b6525388da873ff69e57858570455f04bcaf894c64f0d234b4f918b9b","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:e47daa118","summary":"Fixed: Markdown bodies skip code spans, fenced and indented code; JSON and plain text keep the plain scan; ambiguous structure reads as text. Tests ambiguous_markdown_structure_is_read_as_text, only_markdown_bodies_have_code, an_unclosed_fence_in_a_list_item_ends_with_the_item and hostile_pages_are_scanned_in_one_pass pass in //crates/clax-bot:clax_bot_lib_test. just check at b44c2e9bc: 'Executed 53 out of 381 tests: 381 tests pass.' and 'bazel: all checks passed'.","supersedes":"5a055950154d43cd4602f1a3ddecb1f374a6fccc2e22fc9d303962a3dd8c508e","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:ad4c0f0d-1745-4445-8c27-3925ac4b061a"]}}
